# `term.tree` lowered by hand: one counting loop, no list and no closure. The F6 pair of the demo.

task run
  take size, like number
  like text
  save total, code 0
  walk size
    bind base, code 1
    bind head
      call add
        read size
        code 1
    hook next
      take site, name i
      save total
        call add
          read total
          read i
  send back, text <{{total}}>
